I'd like to see this as well. I assumed it would run in parallel by default since that is what Terraform does. However, I think some explicit dependencies on other runs might be helpful when more complex tests are required.

Example:
```hcl
run "default" {
  command = apply

  module {
    source = "./tests/fixtures/default"
  }
}

run "logging" {
  command = apply

  module {
    source = "./tests/fixtures/logging"
  }

  depends_on = ["default"]
}
```
